nly you can fill. The full gam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T17:26:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042450","verified_at":"2026-10-25T22:39:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5093710-1841579228674912","game_id":"steam-5093710","kind":"announcement","title":"New Pattern Reveal: Neon Grid","summary":"I've been continuing to add new patterns to Illusion Remix, and here's one that didn't make it into the original trailer.Like the other patterns, it can be customized and combined with Illusion Remix's audio-reactive controls to create completely different looks. This one really works well as a desktop background and is very fun to customize!More patterns and improvements are on the way as I continue preparing the game for release! I'm having a blast adding more features and patterns like this.P","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T08:51:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228674912","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5093710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:21Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:21Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5093710":"2026-10-26T08:20:21Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5093710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:21Z"},"5196460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:21Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5093710","app_id":5093710,"app_scope"